window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Once, they were the galaxy’s most fearsome mercenaries…</b><br> <br> A lot has changed since then. Still, a friend is a friend. So, when one of their old crewmates dies under mysterious circumstances, the infamous Billy Firebrand calls the old crew back together for one last mission. With a busted ship, a lifetime’s worth of demons, and a galactic war on the line, they’ll face odds they probably couldn’t have beaten in their prime.<br> <br> These days… they don’t stand a chance.<br> <br> Ride with Billy, Shotgun, Stick, El, and Mouth as the galaxy’s worst mercenaries face impossible odds, hidden enemies, and… hybrid flying squirrel baboons?<br> <br> Fans of <i>The Worst Ship in the Fleet</i> and <i>Rogue Agent</i> will love this new series full of swashbuckling adventure, witty banter, and plenty of sci-fi fun. Tag along with this crew of has-beens as they redefine what it means to be heroes (and not always in a good way). Set in the fan-favorite universe of <i>Dumb Luck and Dead Heroes</i>, you don't need to have listen to that series to fully enjoy this action-packed full-length novel.</p>"; 
